{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52373","headline":"回波乐 十六 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"教君有男女，但令遣出家。\n如山覆一壝（项校「㙺」，通「篑」），似草始生牙。\n剃头并去发，脱俗服袈裟。\n闻钟即礼拜，见佛献香花。\n不思五等贵，宁贪驷马车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52373.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52373","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}